BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_314845839@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260529T041612Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260606T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260606T160000
SUMMARY:The RAD Walk #4: Movement\, Kindness\, and Fresh Air
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\n\\*UPDATE (Construction blockage) - We w
 ill be starting at **229 Riverside Dr.** and walking a path down Lyman str
 eet that takes us past Hi-Wire toward Amboy Road\, and then turning back a
 round.\n\n* **Total Distance:** Approximately 3-4 miles (but your distance
  is your choice).\n* **Time:** About 1.5 hours.\n* **Flexibility:** Rememb
 er\, this is your walk. If 3-4 miles feels like too much\, you can turn ar
 ound at any point (like when we reach Hi-Wire) to head back to the start.\
 n\nWe will meet at the location in the event picture.\nDon't forget the su
 ntan lotion if it's a sunny day :)\nWe will wait 10 minutes after the even
 t time\, and then we start the walk.\n\n* **Pet Policy:** I am a huge dog 
 lover myself (I have 3!) but to ensure the safety and comfort of every hum
 an in our group\, I’ve decided to make these walks dog-free. Some member
 s may have allergies or fears\, and since I can’t predict how different 
 dogs will interact with each other\, I want to keep our environment as str
 ess-free as possible. Thank you for understanding!\n\n\\*Please keep an ey
 e on this meetup event for any updates if weather isn't ideal. If there is
  rain\, we will probably reschedule.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314845839
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260518T143124Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260518T143124Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_314786060@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260529T041612Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T161500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260607T181500
SUMMARY:Fantasy and Sci-Fi Silent Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nBOYB - Bring Your Own Book and rant or r
 ave about your current Fantasy or Sci-fi titles! We will either be in the 
 large room inside or out back on the patio depending on weather.\n\n**What
  is a Silent Book Club?**\nReferred to as "Introvert's Happy Hour"\, Silen
 t Book clubs allow readers to engage with each other without the commitmen
 t of reading a shared title. Community members gather in the same place\, 
 have some casual chit chat\, and then read silently together. **This group
  will focus on Fantasy and Sci-Fi titles (subgenres & related genres are w
 elcome!)**\n\n**How does it work?**\nFor the first 15-30 mins we will gath
 er and engage in introductions. Feel free to discuss your recent favorites
 \, mention a title that lives in your head rent free\, or ask for recommen
 dations! The best part of the Silent Book Club is being able to talk shop 
 with other readers!\n\nOnce settled in we will dedicate 45 minutes to sile
 nt reading. Your book can be traditional\, ebook\, or audiobook. Read at y
 our own pace!\n\nAfterwards we will go around show-and-tell style and shar
 e what we read with the group. Feel free to share as much or as little as 
 you want! Organic dialogue welcome!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314786060
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260514T160527Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260514T160527Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
